  "releaseNotes": "- Support `inline` utility functions with SRTP constraints (e.g. generic `x + y`, `GenericOne`, member constraints)\n- Identical compiler-generated helper functions are emitted only once\n- Utility functions are specialized for constant arguments that resolve conditions in their body; `[<Specialize>]` controls this per parameter or function\n- Fix CPU implementations of `packUnorm2x16`, `packSnorm2x16`, `packUnorm4x8`, `packSnorm4x8` and their unpack counterparts to match GLSL (#40)\n- Add `allocateSharedValue` for non-array shared variables in compute shaders\n- Fix dead-code elimination removing utility functions that only write storage buffers, shared memory or images\n- Inline utility functions with `ref` parameters are inlined again and modify the caller's variable (#38)\n- Fix inlining of values read from a `ref` that is later passed to a function\n- Fix storage buffer access qualifiers (`readonly` / `writeonly`) when composed shaders access the same buffer differently",
